# Post-job verification

After finishing any coding job that changes code in this workspace (frontend `EUNIK` and/or `backend-eunik`):

1. Run **`npm audit`** in each package you changed.
2. Run **typecheck** (`npx tsc -b` / `npx tsc --noEmit`, or the package’s typecheck script).
3. Run **`npm run build`** in each package you changed.

Fix any failures before considering the job done. Report the results briefly (pass/fail; note high/critical audit findings).

Do not skip these steps unless the user explicitly says to skip verification.
